// The references the standard still resolves when a document leaves the semicolon out. Text from
// the era that wrote `&copy` bare reads as a mark rather than as five literal characters; inside
// an attribute value the same spelling stays literal when a name or an `=` follows it, which is
// what keeps a query string intact.
